  "GJ03|942|STORE|$T_GJ_UNTOUCHED;$T_GJ_MIXED"

  # Batch 943 — GJ04, the FTS `rebuild` before the UPDATE is removed. Same
  # lesson as JC08 and V40 before it, and the same reason the expectation is
