  # ---- playhead-lmrx review round 3: the cancel is aimed at jobs (LX25-LX29) ----
  #
  #   * LX25 restores the single-slot aim: `cancelCurrentJob` cancels ONE task
  #     and still returns the whole in-flight set as "what it was aimed at".
